# HDMV_DISC_A (local disc): First Play shows a logo, then starts the feature (title 1, playlist 0) with no menu.
# A menu call during the feature opens the top menu (title 0). Its auto-action pages (0, 1 or 2, then 11) run while
# the menu playlist plays and settle on page 3: buttons 0 play (JUMP_TITLE 1), 1 chapters, 2 page 9, 3 page 10,
# laid out right to left. Then left to chapters and on to page 9's button, back right to play, and play the feature.
wait playlist 0
wait reads 50
key topmenu
wait page 3
wait reads 100
key left
wait reads 20
key left
wait reads 20
key right
wait reads 20
key right
wait reads 20
key ok
wait title 1
wait reads 100
